WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 1, Scene 31h: Lunar Base establishing shot
Duration: ~9 seconds
Source: FF8 Gameplay/Cutscene
Describes the Lunar Base space station in orbit near the moon

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The Lunar Base is revealed in its full majesty. The space station consists of multiple modular sections — cylindrical habitation modules, scientific instruments, communication towers, and massive solar panel arrays extending outward for power generation.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The base orbits against the void of space. Behind it, the moon looms enormous — its surface pockmarked with countless craters of varying sizes. The gray, lifeless terrain stretches to the curvature of the moon.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The stars are brilliant around the base — thousands of points of light scattered across the infinite black void. No atmosphere diffuses their light here. The base is humanity's outpost at the edge of the solar system — isolated, advanced, and utterly alone in the cosmic void.
